{"unit_id":"apherchin__dsh-windows-session-notification#card-zh","repo":"apherchin/dsh-windows-session-notification","commit":"a670453088142daad29f48b0cb620407593ecd05","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-windows-session-notification 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 跨会话提醒插件，通过订阅会话状态并由客户端与宿主路由协作，在未查看的会话完成、出错或等待审批与回答时显示 Windows 通知。通知可点击返回对应会话，并按未读状态更新应用角标；同一时段完成的会话可合并提示。适合需要同时运行多个 DSH 会话的 Windows 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:167","client.js:13","lib/attention-core.mjs:122"]}
{"unit_id":"apherchin__dsh-windows-session-notification#card-en","repo":"apherchin/dsh-windows-session-notification","commit":"a670453088142daad29f48b0cb620407593ecd05","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-windows-session-notification sends Windows alerts for unattended DSH sessions that finish, error, or need approval or an answer. Click an alert to reopen its session. Unread items update the app badge, and nearby completion alerts can be merged. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:167","client.js:13","lib/attention-core.mjs:122"]}
